  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202463
  exerciseText: 'Building System where you can place down building Blueprints, add
    resources and start constructing. Upon finishing the final building is spawned
    and may or may not have extra logic.


    In this Scenario, the Player can pick
    up resources, then place down either a House or a FirePit, construct the buildings,
    and then in the case of the Fire Pit the player can interact with it to add fuel
    to the fire.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files,
    so if you want to keep your own personal implementation of this System then make
    a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
  hintText: 
  solutionText: wrong SO reference
